# Keystone – Getting Started

## Overview
Keystone helps Agile teams understand sprint reality by surfacing capacity, workload, and delivery risk early.

---

## Getting Started

1. Install Keystone from Atlassian Marketplace
2. Open Keystone from the Jira Apps menu
3. Configure your estimation method in Admin Config

---

## Key Features

### Active Work
View sprint progress, milestones, and delivery risk in one place.

### Team Overview
Understand capacity fit, sprint health, and delivery signals.

### Admin Config
Customize Keystone to match your team's estimation method and workflow.

### Calendar
See how meetings impact delivery time.

---

## Tips

- Review Sprint Health Score early in the sprint
- Monitor At-Risk work regularly
- Keep Admin Config aligned with your team's process

